                <mxCell id="p2_e7" style="endArrow=open;startArrow=open;html=1;edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;strokeColor=#b46504;" parent="1" source="p2_mdi" target="p2_p5" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p2_note" value="Production note:&#10;&#10;• All queries to market_data_intraday go through the parent — Postgres routes to the right partition by ticker. App code does NOT reference the child tables directly.&#10;&#10;• etf_options_snapshots Greeks depend on BOTH spot (market_data_daily.close) AND r (daily_rates.dgs3mo_rate). lib/options_greeks.py is the single place this math runs.&#10;&#10;• Stale daily_rates → wrong r → wrong Greeks. Audit 2026-05-08 G.P0.7 traced an old delta to a missed FRED fetch — schema does NOT enforce daily_rates freshness; the application must check (data_as_of pattern).&#10;&#10;• lib/gamma.py aggregates per-strike GEX → King/Gate/Spot/Flip levels used by premarket-brief + signal-monitor." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="512" width="460" height="380" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
