                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p4_e4" style="endArrow=open;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" parent="1" source="p4_wl" target="p4_ir" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p4_note" value="Read this cluster top-to-bottom:&#10;&#10;1. User clicks Refresh in /insights → FastAPI POST /api/insights/report/{ticker}/refresh enqueues a Cloud Task.&#10;2. insight-pipeline Job picks up the task → inserts a row in insight_runs with status=queued, trigger=on_demand.&#10;3. Job moves status to running, looks up the per-role model in model_routing, calls Vertex/Anthropic.&#10;4. On success: writes insight_reports row (UPSERT — same (ticker, as_of) overwrites), sets insight_runs.report_id FK to the new id, status=done.&#10;5. EVERY run (success OR failure) writes a row to insight_reports_history with insight_run_id FK back to the run. The history table's UQ (ticker, as_of, written_at) prevents duplicates at the same instant.&#10;&#10;On report deletion (purge, GDPR-style): the FK SET NULL preserves run + history rows so the audit trail is intact." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="750" width="1260" height="80" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
