                <mxCell id="p6_note" value="Notes: news_sentiment uses ticker_info.relationships to alias-match articles that don't mention the ticker directly (&quot;Apple&quot; → AAPL via name; &quot;TSM&quot; → TSMC via aliases). topics GIN index + economic_events.event_name are the two indexes that drive catalyst-proximity scoring." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666;fontStyle=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
